# Updater signing keys. The private half must never be committed: every
# installed copy trusts only that key, so leaking it means anyone can ship an
# update to them, and losing it means nobody can. This repository is public,
# which makes that the difference between a mistake and an incident.
#
# The directory is ignored as a whole as well as by extension, so a key saved
# there under any name is still covered.
/.tauri/
*.key
*.key.pub
